Copyright 2026 nav_sim contributors

The Go2-W link dimensions, joint names, hierarchy, axes, limits and detailed
visual mesh files are derived from Unitree Robotics' official unitree_ros
repository:
https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_ros/tree/master/robots/go2w_description

The official reference repository is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.
A copy of that license is distributed beside the vendored meshes in
src/go2w_sim/meshes/go2w_official/LICENSE.

nav_sim keeps the official visual meshes unchanged, but replaces mesh collision
geometry with lightweight primitives and adds its own ROS 1 sensors and Gazebo
control plugins. The stick variant replaces the visual meshes with primitives
while retaining the official joint layout.
